docs/ENGINEERING_BLUEPRINT.md:113:EP-01 establishes installed server version, matching official client, native events/permissions/session access and the free-model route. V1/V2 APIs differ materially. Implement one verified route, not speculative dual support. If the supported route changes this contract, use a focused amendment. Do not migrate existing user sessions or change global configuration silently.
