docs/ENGINEERING_BLUEPRINT.md:145:Mutations require unique action ID and expected project revision. Same ID/payload returns existing result; different payload conflicts. Proposed input limit 64 KiB. Validate structured model proposals; partial/malformed output cannot replace an approved artifact or execute work.
docs/ENGINEERING_BLUEPRINT.md:178:Statuses: NOT_STARTED/DRAFT/APPROVED/STALE. The application enforces state; model prose cannot approve itself or advance stages. Use the complete active prompt plus approved upstream records and concise current state, not all four full prompts every turn or abbreviated replacements.
docs/ENGINEERING_BLUEPRINT.md:180:This behavior is inside the product. The current user explicitly requested direct documentation amendments; these edits do not require eight new chat approvals. The full project prompt is maintained locally, not in the global Library source.
docs/ENGINEERING_BLUEPRINT.md:200:Cover empty/generating/slow/awaiting approval/revision/native permission/malformed response/provider failure/failed check/unknown run/stale approval/success. Give concrete recovery, preserve current section and revision text, and never overwrite approved content with a partial stream. Fixture/live responses share schemas and explicit section versions/status; fixtures cannot establish execution or sponsor proof.

